ing` = `base_rating` (percentile-weighted stat score) + `game_adj` + individual boosts (minutes, 3P, FG, AST, BLK, double-double, triple-double, FT). Each component stored as its own column so the \"Rating Breakdown\" section in the player modal can show the decomposition.\n30\t\n31\t**Pages**\n32\t- `/index.html` — Rankings table with sidebar filters (sliders per stat, position/class chips), per-game↔totals toggle, map view\n33\t- `/similarity.html` — Find players similar to a given player; uses `player_similarity` table\n34\t- `/player.html` — Full player profile page (bio, all seasons, advanced stats, similarity)\n35\t\n36\t**Why:** Decision-support tool for evaluating college basketball players, especially for NIL contexts.\n37\t",
